WEBVTT

00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:07.082
How did your toys get
all the way out here?

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:08.499
[grunts]

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.583
[tablet chirps]

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:12.999
what IS this?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.332
haha I got it too!!!

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:15.249
lost your TOYS bonnie?

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.958
[gasps]

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.667
how many do u have? ahaha

00:00:23.792 --> 00:00:24.792
[gasps]

00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:35.041
Oh, how 'bout this one?
Ah, look at those puppies.

00:00:35.042 --> 00:00:36.541
I'm saving that one.

00:00:36.542 --> 00:00:38.624
Yeah, they came with the
latest update this morning.

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:39.916
I know. It never gets old.

00:00:39.917 --> 00:00:40.999
[chuckling] She's here.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.582
Careful, Snappy. Dad might see you.

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:45.375
No way. He'll be showing off
those new backgrounds forever.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.457
[gasps] That's her! That's Bonnie!

00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:51.083
- Bullseye, she's really here!
- [blusters]

00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:54.083
Bonnie, come on, let's go.

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.291
[coughs] Buzz, listen. I really just...

00:01:02.292 --> 00:01:03.625
[Woody groans]

00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:07.291
[Atlas] Aw. [chuckles]

00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:09.041
It was nothing. It was nothing.

00:01:09.042 --> 00:01:12.124
Thanks, fellas.
Pretty glad I met you devices.

00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:14.416
Ah, don't be dumping us
something you can't flush.

00:01:14.417 --> 00:01:16.542
- [doorbell rings]
- [gasps] It's her!

00:01:18.875 --> 00:01:20.457
Hello. Can I help you?

00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:22.916
Hi. I'm so sorry to bother you,

00:01:22.917 --> 00:01:24.999
but we got this message
from your daughter.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.457
She seems to have found
my daughter's toys.

00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:29.041
- Are they in there?
- [Blaze's mom] Oh, okay.

00:01:29.042 --> 00:01:30.416
I'll have her get 'em.

00:01:30.417 --> 00:01:32.332
- Blaze! Honey?
- [Blaze] Yeah?

00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:34.791
Can you bring down
those two rag dolls you found?

00:01:34.792 --> 00:01:37.082
- Their owner's here.
- [Blaze] Okay!

00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:39.458
- That's our cue.
- [footsteps approaching]

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:50.207
[gasps]

00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:52.333
Blaze, this is, uh...

00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:54.249
[Bonnie's mom] This is Bonnie.

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:55.332
[Blaze's mom] Hello, Bonnie.

00:01:55.333 --> 00:01:57.375
Hi. Are these your toys?

00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:06.374
I don't play with toys anymore.

00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:09.708
It's just they're antiques.

00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:13.792
They do look pretty old.

00:02:14.417 --> 00:02:16.708
Must be worth something at least, right?

00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:20.000
No, they're not.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:22.500
You should keep 'em.

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:26.291
[both gasp]

00:02:26.292 --> 00:02:27.750
- [gasps]
- Oh, no.

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.125
Bonnie, you don't want them?

00:02:36.417 --> 00:02:39.917
[stammers] Are you sure? Bonnie? Bonnie?

00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:41.957
I don't know what's come over her.

00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:43.832
I'm so sorry to have bothered you.

00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:45.082
It's all right.

00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:48.166
If you ever change your mind,
Bonnie, just let me know.

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.417
[♪ mournful music playing]

00:02:56.583 --> 00:02:57.582
[door closes]

00:02:57.583 --> 00:02:59.166
I don't get it. What just happened?

00:02:59.167 --> 00:03:00.708
What is going on, Bonnie?

00:03:01.875 --> 00:03:03.333
Okay, I guess we're going.

00:03:04.167 --> 00:03:06.458
- [sniffles]
- [car door opens, closes]

00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:11.624
[all gasp, grunt]

00:03:11.625 --> 00:03:13.083
[footsteps approaching]

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:22.250
[door creaks]

00:03:23.542 --> 00:03:24.582
[gasps]

00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:27.791
Come on, Bullseye! Quick!
Before they drive away!

00:03:27.792 --> 00:03:29.208
[grunting]

00:03:29.792 --> 00:03:31.249
It's... It's too late for me,

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.249
Bullseye, but maybe not for you.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.916
- Please, not for you.
- [blusters]

00:03:34.917 --> 00:03:38.458
[grunts, breathing heavily]

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:40.500
- [whinnies]
- [Jessie sighs]

00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:45.207
- Sheriff?
- Jessie? A-Are you okay?

00:03:45.208 --> 00:03:46.707
W-What just happened?

00:03:46.708 --> 00:03:48.291
She ditched you, Jessie.

00:03:48.292 --> 00:03:49.957
Because of you!

00:03:49.958 --> 00:03:52.291
Because of all you darn devices

00:03:52.292 --> 00:03:54.166
making kids act older.

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:56.207
You stole all our time.

00:03:56.208 --> 00:03:59.082
I wanted to make a difference.
I needed to make a difference.

00:03:59.083 --> 00:04:00.499
And you ruined it.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.582
- Ow.
- [gasps]

00:04:01.583 --> 00:04:03.707
- Smarty, you okay?
- I'm-I'm sorry.

00:04:03.708 --> 00:04:07.041
- Are you hurt? Did you crack?
- I'm fine. I'm fine. [sighs]

00:04:07.042 --> 00:04:09.208
For a rag doll, you throw
quite a punch, cowgir...

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:11.458
Cowgirl?

00:04:12.833 --> 00:04:14.457
- [devices gasp]
- [Bullseye whinnies]

00:04:14.458 --> 00:04:15.583
[Snappy] Jessie?

00:04:22.208 --> 00:04:23.750
[whistles]

00:04:25.417 --> 00:04:27.082
Uh, Sheriff?

00:04:27.083 --> 00:04:28.832
I'm sorry, Smarty.

00:04:28.833 --> 00:04:30.125
It's not you.

00:04:31.042 --> 00:04:33.207
I'm the one that's useless.

00:04:33.208 --> 00:04:34.625
- [devices gasp]
- [blusters]

00:04:37.583 --> 00:04:38.583
[whinnies]

